{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Environmental News", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Save the Lake", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Simple Past Passive", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you are writing a news article or giving an interview, you can include the Simple Past Passive to describe something done by someone at sometime in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In a regular sentence structure, you use Subject + verb + object.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Governing bodies never properly carried out regulations regarding pollution.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In the Simple Past Passive form, you use the structure:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Object + <span class=\"italic\">was</span> / <span class=\"italic\">were</span> + past participle + <span class=\"italic\">by</span> Subject</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Regulations regarding pollution were never properly carried out by any governing body.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "This poisonous parasite was first introduced by the increased amount of noxious bacteria released into the waters. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Research was conducted regarding its long-term effect.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Although warnings were given to offenders, they were never taken seriously.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Conditional Sentences with <span class=\"italic\">If</span> Clause", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>You use the first conditional with If clauses to talk about real possibilities in the future.</p><p>You use the second conditional to talk about unreal or imaginary (hypothetical) situations in the future.</p>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do or not do something. In that condition, something else may, will or will not happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The parts of the sentence are divided into two clauses: the <span class=\"italic\">If</span> clause and the <span class=\"italic\">Condition</span> clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the Second Conditional to talk about hypothetical situations. It's not certain that it's possible to fulfill the condition.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">If I had a million dollars, I would buy a car.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do you have a million dollars?  No. <br/>Is it possible to suddenly get a million dollars? Not really.<br/>What would you do if you had a million dollars? Buy a car.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past verb + <span class=\"italic\">would</span></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">First Conditional:<br/>1st Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">First Conditional:<br/>2nd Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If we keep the lake in its current state,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">we will face an ecological disaster of catastrophic proportions.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible that we keep the lake in its current state. In this condition, we will face an ecological disaster.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Second Conditional:<br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span> ... + Simple Past</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Second Conditional:<br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">would</span> + base verb</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Result</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If the perpetrators were fined or jailed, </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">maybe things would change.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It is not certain that the perpetrators will be fined or jailed. What would happen if it did? Things would change.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hazardous", "type": "name"}, {"content": "dangerous; risky", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Gallons of hazardous substances are being poured in the water every day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about an environmental problem.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "horrified", "type": "name"}, {"content": "filled with horror; shocked", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Environmental organizations were horrified by the most recent report on the state of Lake Kachanawa. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "waste material", "type": "name"}, {"content": "any substance considered worthless or unwanted", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Thousands of gallons of hazardous waste materials are being poured into its waters every day. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "poisonous", "type": "name"}, {"content": "capable of causing death or illness if taken into the body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Poisonous parasites were introduced into the water over the years.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "alga", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a plant organism found in water", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In recent years, a new type of alga has appeared in the lake. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "noxious", "type": "name"}, {"content": "poisonous", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The increased amount of noxious bacteria released into the waters is causing the death of many species.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "disaster", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an accident that causes great damage and loss of life", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If we keep the lake in its current state, we will face an ecological disaster.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "catastrophic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "involving great damage and suffering", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We will face an ecological disaster of catastrophic proportions.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to perish", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to die in a violent, sudden way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: People will flee and wildlife will perish if we don't safeguard this important water source. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob07aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "With a partner, brainstorm the types of things that the government does for its people in times of a natural disaster.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down what the government does and then create sentences using the Past Passive.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Imagine you are the mayor of your city and are running for re-election. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss what things were done by your government after a huge hurricane hit your city last year.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a speech to the class using the passive voice to talk about the accomplishments.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about natural disasters.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about local news. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about cause and effect and hypothetical situations.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}